{"type":"message","id":"d026a55e","parentId":"40604ef3","timestamp":"2026-04-01T22:40:02.425Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying the Chinese characters in the images are garbled/mojibake. This is a known issue with image generation models - they often can't render Chinese text properly. Let me think about what images had Chinese text issues...\n\nThe images that were sent include:\n- Various biology diagrams (photosynthesis, digestive system, etc.)\n- Answer card images (q2, q21, q26, q27, q29, q30, q31, q33)\n\nThe Chinese text garbling issue is common with AI image generation tools - they often render Chinese characters as random symbols or boxes. This is a fundamental limitation of current image generation models.\n\nI should acknowledge the issue and perhaps offer some solutions:\n1. Use English text instead (if the model supports it better)\n2. Manually add Chinese labels using image editing tools\n\n\n3. Find a workaround like using a different approach to handle the text rendering\n\nThis is more of an open claw or image generation model limitation rather than something I can directly fix in this conversation.","thinkingSignature":"9e8a401a111ec4e5f9e6bc81488574a1252c5d4ae5a65a0bd68d7c3d8bdf6199"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n是的，这是图生图模型的中文乱码问题，目前还是老大难——模型对中文文本的渲染能力本来就弱，加上生成时字体渲染不对，很容易出现这个问题。\n\n**有几个解法思路：**\n\n1. **生成纯英文版本** — 换成英文标签，模型对英文渲染好很多（刚刚发的那些英文图的文字应该是正常的）\n\n2. **先生成图，再叠加文字** — 用工具在图片上叠一层中文（Photoshop、Sketch、Canva都行），避免模型写中文\n\n3. **换更强文字渲染的模型** — 比如 GPT-4o 画图对英文支持更好，中文还是不行\n\n频哥你主要用在哪个场景？我看看怎么绕过去最方便 🙏\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":134,"output":367,"cacheRead":47858,"cacheWrite":705,"totalTokens":49064,"cost":{"input":0.0000402,"output":0.00044039999999999997,"cacheRead":0.0028714799999999996,"cacheWrite":0.000264375,"total":0.0036164549999999993}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775083172292,"responseId":"061cd1a48668396