{"type":"message","id":"bbf9f6e7","parentId":"119a6313","timestamp":"2026-04-01T23:05:39.295Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have `PingFang.ttc` and `STHeiti` fonts available which support Chinese. Let me write the script to overlay Chinese text on an image. I'll use PIL with these fonts.\n\nLet me write a Python script that:\n1. Takes an image path and text as input\n2. Loads the image\n3. Adds Chinese text at the bottom\n4. Returns the result\n\nLet me first test with a sample image.","thinkingSignature":"73e10ef10cc01d35e5ec2d26396bd2b84300d005a6ba529923e3225d58839d28"},{"type":"text","text":"好，先测试一下效果～\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3titdfjbb2j6_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont\nimport os\n\n# 测试用图\nimg_path = \"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/tool-image-generation/image-1---83397188-aad5-463f-a05c-f3613d15bb7c.png\"\ntext = \"光合作用示意图\"\n\n# 加载图片\nimg = Image.open(img_path)\nprint(f\"图片尺寸: {img.size}\")\n\n# 字体路径\nfont_paths = [\n    \"/System/Library/Fonts/PingFang.ttc\",\n    \"/System/Library/Fonts/STHeiti Light.ttc\",\n]\nfont_path = font_paths[0]\n\n# 估算字体大小（图片高度的4%）\nfont_size = max(int(img.height * 0.05), 20)\ntry:\n    font = ImageFont.truetype(font_path, font_size)\nexcept:\n    font = ImageFont.load_default()\n\n# 文字区域高度\npadding = int(img.height * 0.02)\ntext_height = font_size + padding * 2\n\n# 创建新画布（底部留白）\nnew_img = Image.new(\"RGB\", (img.width, img.height + text_height), \"white\")\nnew_img.paste(img, (0, 0))\n\n# 绘制文字\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(new_img)\nbbox = draw.textbbox((0, 0), text, font=font)\ntext_w = bbox[2] - bbox[0]\ntext_h = bbox[3] - bbox[1]\nx = (img.width - text_w) // 2\ny = img.height + padding\n\ndraw.text((x, y), text, font=font, fill=\"black\")\n\n# 保存\nout_path = \"/tmp/text_overlay_test.png\"\nnew_img.save(out_path)\nprint(f\"保存到: {out_path}\")\nEOF"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":12599,"output":508,"cacheRead":37308,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50415,"cost":{"input":0.0037797,"output":0.0006096,"cacheRead":0.0022384799999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00662778}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775084726736,"responseId":"061cd7b75478dd26906ed676312109a1"}}
