{"type":"message","id":"194a6c51","parentId":"60f5f7c6","timestamp":"2026-04-01T23:05:48.819Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The PIL-based approach seems to work for generating text overlays. Now I should create a reusable script that I can run whenever the user wants to add Chinese text to an image. Let me save the script somewhere and give it a simple interface.\n\nThe user will send me:\n1. Image path \n2. Chinese text to add\n\nAnd I'll run the script to produce the result.\n\nLet me make a proper script that's easy to use.","thinkingSignature":"ef8c60c5cfdba8484366235d48913eed7b1dc17fbbeff5e3965ad33a64d148e6"},{"type":"text","text":"\n文字渲染正常！把这个脚本保存好，以后你发图片路径+文字给我，我就能加上中文标签了～\n\n你要加什么文字？告我图片和内容试试 🌟"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":13279,"output":128,"cacheRead":37308,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50715,"cost":{"input":0.0039837,"output":0.0001536,"cacheRead":0.0022384799999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.006375779999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775084743203,"responseId":"061cd7c7da8ef49332559ed63614ace6"}}
