{"type":"message","id":"e41d30f6","parentId":"6cae28ce","timestamp":"2026-04-01T23:06:46.164Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying the text *inside* the image is still garbled. So they're not talking about my overlay script - they're talking about the AI-generated images themselves having garbled Chinese text inside them (like the labels in a diagram).\n\nThis is a fundamental limitation of the image generation model - it can't render Chinese text properly. The overlay approach I created adds text *outside/below* the image, but the user wants the text *inside* the image to not be garbled.\n\nThe only real solutions are:\n1. Generate images with English text only (and maybe add Chinese labels below)\n2. Use a different approach - generate the image without text, then overlay Chinese labels\n\n\n3. Find a model that's better at rendering Chinese text\n\nThe overlay script works fine for adding text below the image, but the user wants to fix the text that's actually embedded in the image itself. With the current model, the only viable approach is to regenerate without Chinese text and use the overlay method for Chinese labels instead.","thinkingSignature":"2d1d91f30b8b23f7a90f5002b99419cb84ba3f735feae968952ddfea44ecfccc"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n啊！你是说图片**里面**原本的文字乱码，不是外面加的那层～\n\n这个是模型本身的问题，它画中文标签就是会乱码，目前没有技术手段能彻底解决 😅\n\n**能用的是这个组合拳：**\n1. 生成图片时**不带中文标签**（我会在 prompt 里避免中文）\n2. 图片下方的标签用 overlay 叠加中文（就是刚才那个脚本，文字清晰）\n\n生物图的话，比如光合作用、呼吸作用，其实我之前生成过英文版的，标签本来就是英文，可以直接用～\n\n**以后流程是这样：**\n> 你：发图片路径 + \"加中文标签：xxx\"\n> 我：用 overlay 在底部加清晰的中文标签\n\n要我以后生成生物图时都避免中文，只在外部叠加中文吗？🙌\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":134,"output":376,"cacheRead":49282,"cacheWrite":1216,"totalTokens":51008,"cost":{"input":0.0000402,"output":0.00045119999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0029569199999999996,"cacheWrite":0.000456,"total":0.0039043199999999993}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1