{"type":"message","id":"c957cd96","parentId":"c0a89ddf","timestamp":"2026-04-01T23:45:06.649Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to try the solution where I avoid Chinese text in generated images and only add Chinese labels via overlay. I should generate an image with English labels and then add Chinese text overlay. Let me pick a biology topic - maybe photosynthesis or something similar.\n\nLet me generate an image first, then add Chinese overlay. I'll make sure the prompt is in English to avoid the model generating Chinese text inside the image.","thinkingSignature":"d6cde16002723687ac42a248cbdb40662f3ec1ae4855208bf914f92d320a6255"},{"type":"text","text":"好，来试一下！先生成一张英文标签的呼吸作用示意图，再叠加中文～\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_eb0nn5zr946t_1","name":"image_generate","arguments":{"prompt":"A clean, colorful science diagram of cellular respiration process, showing the three main stages (glycolysis, Krebs cycle, electron transport chain) in a plant cell. Clean white background. English labels only: \"Cellular Respiration\", \"Cytoplasm\", \"Mitochondria\", \"ATP\". No Chinese text. Scientific textbook style, clear and educational."}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":134,"output":197,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":50930,"totalTokens":51261,"cost":{"input":0.0000402,"output":0.0002364,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.01909875,"total":0.01937535}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775087095914,"responseId":"061ce0f83ddf330042befad80f843649"}}
